# Applied by Driver/build-driver.ps1 to Microsoft NCM-Driver-for-Windows
# release_2004 host/device.cpp.
#
# Minimal Apple-specific change:
#   - select the first CDC NCM communication interface with one interrupt
#     endpoint (iOS tethering function);
#   - associate its data interface using the CDC Union descriptor;
#   - do not let the later iOS RemoteXPC NCM-like function overwrite the
#     selected control/data pair;
#   - retain Microsoft's existing WDF interface lookup and configuration
#     lifecycle, including initial alt-setting 0 selection.
#   - emit diagnostic information showing the WDF interface count and actual
#     USB interface numbers/settings presented by usbccgp.
#
# No EvtDevicePrepareHardware replacement is performed and the data interface
# is NOT forced to alternate setting 1 during initial configuration.
